    <li>AzraelGodKing.Homesteader</li>
    <li>AzraelGodKing.Stormproof</li>
    <li>BiomesTeam.BiomesCore</li>
    <li>BiomesTeam.CoreFramework</li>
    <li>BiomesTeam.BiomesCaverns</li>
    <li>m00nl1ght.GeologicalLandforms</li>
    <li>Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey</li>
    <!-- Optional: VGE Chapter 1 overhauls gravships; load Strata after so stack-follow patches win. -->
    <li>vanillaexpanded.gravship</li>
    <!-- Optional: ReGrowth splash cache runs on FinalizeInit; load Strata after. -->
    <li>ReGrowth.BOTR.Core</li>
    <li>Helixien.ReGrowthCore</li>
    <!-- Optional: Combat Extended replaces shoot verbs; load Strata after so turret patches attach. -->
    <li>CETeam.CombatExtended</li>
  </loadAfter>
  <description>Dig down. Build up. One colony — many floors. Colonists commute for work, food, rest, hauling, combat, and construction. Odyssey optional for gravship stacks.

Do not run alongside AASB, AASB 2, or MultiFloors. Requires Harmony. RimWorld 1.6. Safe to add mid-save.

Full notes: https://azraelgodking.github.io/rimworld_mods/strata
Discord: https://discord.gg/Vwh2y7qMXv</description>
